        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5061] If EVCC uses ServiceName = WPT from Table 204, after receiving the PowerDeliveryRes with \"ResponseCode = WARNING_WPT\", the EVCC shall send a WPT_FinePositioningSetupReq or terminate by sending a SessionStopReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 218.",
            "block_bbox": [
