            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5058] After receiving a WPT_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = WARNING_WPT\", the EVCC shall send a WPT_AlignmentCheckReq or a WPT_PairingReq or terminate by sending a SessionStopReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
