        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5039] If the EVCC wants to continue the energy transfer and received the WPT_ChargeLoopRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\", the EVCC shall send another WPT_ChargeLoopReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 218.",
